+///   it records.
+/// The first present also logs "EDEN_GBB_ENV count=N KEY=VALUE ..." with every EDEN_, RADV_, MESA_ and ACO_ variable
+///   the process actually has (the effective env, for checking a run's env.txt), when any of these switches is set.
+/// Marker (headless pad.cpp, 0923): touchpad + R3 logs "EDEN_GBB_MARK n=<k>" and records a Mark event: press it
+///   when you see a flash or start walking. Neither button reaches the game while the chord is held.
